\\\\\n&=-2\\mathbf{b}+\\left(-\\frac{7}{2}\\mathbf{a}\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\frac{7}{2}\\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nBecause $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are nonparallel, these coefficients are unique. Comparing with $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b}$ gives $\\lambda=-\\frac{7}{2}$. The minus sign records the reversed direction." 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761563 1075 #edb/ref 17592186761586 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761563 1075 #edb/ref 17592186761591 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761563 1075 #edb/ref 17592186761592 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761563 1075 #edb/ref 17592186761593 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761563 1075 #edb/ref 17592186761594 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761563 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761563 1077 "selection" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761563 1078 #edb/ref 17592186761593 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761563 1079 #uuid "4d3a7dfd-60aa-5b7f-8b26-3e8571dc6374" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761564 1080 "-2" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761564 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761564 1083 #uuid "53903e91-264c-5950-8720-3c35a1f5535a" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761565 1068 #edb/ref 17592186761595 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761565 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761565 1071 "The three vectors share an origin, and each grid square has the same side length.\n\n![](images/01/016049db389747b5de548d97dbb7501dee2d0a4c0c3f0d28ada38ff5bde37965.png)\n\nGiven $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}-4\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$." 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761565 1072 #uuid "60bed3d7-87d0-585c-a69a-78b3e9347c0f" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761565 1074 "First trace $-4\\mathbf{b}$ from t