errightarrow{OP}+\\overrightarrow{PC}\\\\\n&=-3\\mathbf{b}+\\left(-\\frac{5}{2}\\mathbf{a}\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\frac{5}{2}\\mathbf{a}-3\\mathbf{b}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nBecause $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are nonparallel, these coefficients are unique. Comparing with $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}-3\\mathbf{b}$ gives $\\lambda=-\\frac{5}{2}$. The minus sign records the reversed direction." 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761588 1068 #edb/ref 17592186761577 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761588 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761588 1071 "The three vectors share an origin, and each grid square has the same side length.\n\n![](images/c5/c5005b41d3043021e1578181865fbbff202dbd374ad4c5c7a612119c84c50e7a.png)\n\nIf $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}-3\\mathbf{b}$, then $\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}." 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761588 1072 #uuid "e5e9d9ef-4bff-5ec3-8248-1e14edc7489e" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761588 1074 "First trace $-3\\mathbf{b}$ from the common origin $O$ to a point $P$: reverse its direction and scale its length. The remaining path from $P$ to the endpoint $C$ must be the unknown multiple of $\\mathbf{a}$.\n\n![](images/01/012ff6ccf1a14477bb728f501e08c8062ac30f3fafe4c875374c86123a0299fa.png)\n\nFollowing the grid direction of $\\mathbf{a}$ takes $2$ steps, while the parallel path $PC$ has $2$ steps. Their length ratio is $\\frac{2}{2}=1$. The remaining path points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{a}$, so\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{PC}=-\\mathbf{a}.\n$$\nAdding the path vectors gives\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OP}+\\overrightarrow{PC}\\\\\n&=-3\\mathbf{b}+(-\\mathbf{a})\\\\\n&=-\\mathbf{a}-3\\mathbf{b}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nBecause $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are nonparallel, these coefficients are unique. Comparing with $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}-3\\mathbf{b}$ gives $\\lambda=-1$. The minus sign records the reversed direction." 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761589 1080 "-\\frac{14}{3}" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761589 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761589 1083 #uuid "e9d5e5b1-fb61-5934-bfc7-df1e8a80d993" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761590 1075 #edb/ref 17592186761583 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761590 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761590 1077 "field-1" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761590 1078 #edb/ref 17592186761583 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761590 1079 #uuid "eae5d6fa-3690-5bf0-b356-1952bbc48b0e" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761591 1080 "-7" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761591 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761591 1083 #uuid "eb1ff109-5171-5ae4-b5a2-1fdd719da959" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761592 1080 "-3" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761592 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761592 1083 #uuid "f525cc52-199b-51c4-8ad3-0756db2d62a0" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761593 1080 "-\\frac{7}{2}" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761593 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761593 1083 #uuid "f836cdc9-1939-5f4c-ae06-42f076ca0705" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761594 1080 "-\\frac{2}{7}" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761594 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761594 1083 #uuid "f93daf1e-abb5-5781-96a6-2b36effea11a" 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761595 1075 #edb/ref 17592186761570 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761595 1075 #edb/ref 17592186761571 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761595 1075 #edb/ref 17592186761572 13194139547594 17592186576411 true] [17592186761595 1075 #edb/ref 1759218